      "start_seconds": 191.18,
      "end_seconds": 200.76,
      "duration_seconds": 9.58,
      "text": "okay: blood pressure 131 over 83, respiratory rate 19. And temperature 36.9, SpO2 99 percent on room air, pulse 112."
