      "start_seconds": 262.99,
      "end_seconds": 293.44,
      "duration_seconds": 30.45,
      "text": "You can relax now. Okay, so my impression is this: This is probably a possible heart rhythm problem like atrial fibrillation. I'm sending you for a Holter monitor because of palpitations. I'm going to order an ECG, for palpitations. I'll start you on metoprolol, 25 milligrams, twice a day, until we review. You take it by mouth. That should help with palpitations. The pharmacy will go through the details again when you pick it up."
